--
--   **Context.** `PipeGBA6`, part 1: one chirp row keeps `GB (p + 2)`
--
--   **`chirpC_gb`**: if every input entry has parts of bit size `≤ p + 2` (so `‖U_i‖ ≤ 4√2 · 2^p`),
--   every output entry of `chirpC p s t α H` has parts of bit size `≤ p + 2`:
